    "2 cups hot mashed potatoes",
    "4 ounces PHILADELPHIA Cream Cheese, cubed",
    "1 cup KRAFT Shredded Cheddar Cheese, divided",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "4 cups frozen mixed vegetables, thawed",
    "1 cup beef gravy"
